                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy non-**^^Monster Hero^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Both players roll off. If you win the roll-off, roll off again. Keep rolling off in this way until you lose the roll-off. Then, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the number of roll-offs made as part of this ability that you won this turn.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
