                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Monster^^** or **^^War Machine^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to the target&apos;s Health characteristic. Add 1 to each roll for each consecutive turn in which the target was picked to be the target of this ability. For each 6+, allocate 1 mortal damage to the target (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).</characteristic>
