                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 5+, this unit can use a Prayer ability from the prayer lore you picked during army composition as if it had Priest (1). Instead of making a chanting roll for that prayer, the chanting roll is 5 and cannot be modified.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
